Zangbundel bibliotheek van Pepe

All songs in this library are in the public domain: their lyricists and
composers died more than 70 years ago, or the songs are traditional.

The collection itself (the selection, the transcriptions, the metadata and
this documentation) and the two menus in the root folder
(menu-with-tutorial-for-release-process.py, menu-for-release-process.bat)
are dedicated to the public domain under the
Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication.

The tools under scripts/ are not covered by this dedication; they are
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 with the Commons Clause, see
scripts/LICENSE.

To the extent possible under law, the maintainer has waived all copyright
and related or neighboring rights to this collection. You can copy, modify,
distribute and perform it, even for commercial purposes, without asking
permission.

Full legal text: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
